OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer's skull fractured as
OL,4,Adriver leaves scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has been left with a
OL,7,Ffractured skull after being seriously
OL,8,Finjured while trying to stop a car in
OL,9,FNuneaton.
OL,11,FWarwickshire Police said an officer
OL,12,Fattempted to stop and speak to the
OL,13,Foccupants of a "suspicious" black BMW
OL,14,Fin Kingswood Road at about 15:00 BST on
OL,15,FSunday, when the driver drove off.
OL,17,FThe officer, who was not identified,
OL,18,Fsuffered a fractured skull and remained
OL,19,Fin hospital in a serious condition, the
OL,20,Fforce said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
